`charge under s 392` with `Chen Weixiong Jerriek` 's `text` is equal to You, Chen Weixiong Jerriek, are charged that you, on or about the 5th day of July 2002, at about 1.00pm, at void deck of Blk 121, Lor 1 Toa Payoh, Singapore, together with Koh Bang Long and Chia Jia Ting Samuel and in furtherance of the common intention of you all, did rob one Ng Juin Chye Joel of a handphone valued at about $450/-, and you have thereby committed an offence punishable under section 392 read with section 34 of the Penal Code 1871.
`charge under s 392` with `Chen Weixiong Jerriek` 's `punishment` is equal to imprisonment for a term of not less than 2 years and not more than 10 years and shall also be punished with caning with not less than 6 strokes
