`charge under s 392` with `Chen Weixiong Jerriek, no aggravation` 's `refusal` is equal to A charge under section 392 would assert that the facts fulfil every legal condition of robbery (CPC s 123(5)). On the facts given they do not: neither the aggravation that makes a theft robbery (section 390(2)) nor the one that makes an extortion robbery (section 390(3)).
